OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FGianni Infantino is facing increasing
OL,8,Fpressure over his role as Fifa's
OL,9,Fpresident, after he attempted to sell
OL,10,Foff stakes in the World Cup to private
OL,11,Finvestors.
OL,13,FOn Monday, Wales became the first
OL,14,Fnation to withdraw support for his re-
OL,15,Felection bid, which is scheduled to
OL,16,Fhappen in March.
OL,18,FThe English Football Association is
OL,19,Falso understood to have written to
OL,20,FFifa, making it clear it no longer
OL,21,Fsupports Infantino.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
