OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FMeanwhile, a number of African and
OL,8,FAsian FAs issued statements of support
OL,9,Fover the weekend, including those from
OL,10,FMorocco, Egypt and Qatar.
OL,12,FSo could Gianni Infantino be removed
OL,13,Ffrom his role? And what would that
OL,14,Fprocess look like? ITV News explains.
OL,16,FCould Infantino be sacked as Fifa
OL,17,Fpresident?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
