OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FIt is possible to trigger a vote of no
OL,8,Fconfidence in Infantino, but it would
OL,9,Frequire 43 out of the 211 member
OL,10,Fassociations to call for this.
OL,12,FThis would lead to the convening of
OL,13,Fthe Extraordinary Fifa Congress, which
OL,14,Foften handles more urgent decisions
OL,15,Flike leadership elections.
OL,17,FA new and credible candidate would
OL,18,Fneed to be named by November 18, four
OL,19,Fmonths ahead of the vote in Rabat,
OL,20,FMorocco, where FIFA has its African
OL,21,Fheadquarters.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
