OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785779367
OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FHowever, no candidate has yet come
OL,8,Fforward.
OL,10,FAnother way Infantino could be
OL,11,Funseated is by losing the next
OL,12,Fpresidential contest.
OL,14,FIt would take 106 votes to ensure a
OL,15,Fmajority in a contested election.
OL,17,FInfantino was reelected unopposed in
OL,18,F2019 and 2023. Under the current Fifa
OL,19,FStatutes, he is allowed one more four-
OL,20,Fyear term as president.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
