OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FHow is the president elected?
OL,9,FThe Fifa president is elected through
OL,10,Fa secret ballot, where all 211 member
OL,11,Fassociations cast a vote.
OL,13,FEach candidate needs to be nominated
OL,14,Fby at least one member, to have played
OL,15,Fan active role in a football
OL,16,Fassociation in two of the last five
OL,17,Fyears, and must pass Fifa's
OL,18,Feligibility checks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
