OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FThere will then be rounds of voting
OL,8,Funtil one candidate holds a majority.
OL,9,FIf a candidate receives more than two-
OL,10,Fthirds of the vote in the first round,
OL,11,Fthey will become the next president.
OL,13,FIf only one candidate stands, they can
OL,14,Fbe elected without a formal secret
OL,15,Fballot.
OL,17,FHas a president been unseated before?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
