OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FSir Stanley Rous, former secretary of
OL,8,Fthe English FA, was the last incumbent
OL,9,Fpresident to be unseated in an
OL,10,Felection in 1974.
OL,12,FHe was succeeded by Brazil's Joao
OL,13,FHavelange, who became the second-
OL,14,Flongest-serving Fifa president in
OL,15,Fhistory.
OL,17,FWho could replace Infantino?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
