OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FSources have indicated to the Press
OL,8,FAssociation that CONCACAF's president
OL,9,FVictor Montagliani, a current FIFA
OL,10,Fvice-president, would be prepared to
OL,11,Frun for football's top position.
OL,13,FParis Saint-Germain's Nasser Al-
OL,14,FKhelaifi has also been named as a
OL,15,Fpotential candidate.
OL,17,FAl-Khelaifi was a member of the
OL,18,Forganising committee for the World
OL,19,FCup, and has been a member of UEFA's
OL,20,FExecutive Committee for seven years.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
