OL,3,CCould Gianni Infantino be removed as
OL,4,CFifa's president, and how would it
OL,5,Cwork?
OL,7,FAlso considered a potential challenger
OL,8,Fis Mattias Grafstrom, the General
OL,9,FSecretary of Fifa.
OL,11,FHe already works closely with
OL,12,FInfantino and has been a member of the
OL,13,FFifa Council since 2019.
